    "detailed_description": "A true sirvival horror story about how the INEXAR spacecraft (flight number # 19ABY1) arrived to refuel at the &quot;Unusual Star&quot;, a scientific space station studying the star GlieZe V666.<br />\r\nINEXAR Captain Viktor Hill is a researcher, he is not a soldier, but he will not only have to fight with scientists overcome by evil, but also face a sense of fear and loneliness.<br />\r\nAnd you have to decide what is the real evil for you? <br />\r\nMaybe someone else is behind this evil...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd you can completely immerse yourself in history with the help of:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n! First-person view<br />\r\n! Survivial horror atmosphere<br />\r\n! Complicated story<br />\r\n! Interesting Puzzles<br />\r\n! Space locations with breathtaking views",
